{"id": "86241", "name": "AlgMap-15.7", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "Re-write the following in \"completed square\" form:\n\n\\[ {{CT:0}}. \\]\n<br>\n[[input:ans]]\n[[validation:ans]]\n\n<br>\n(i.e. the form \\(\\left({{CT:1}}+a\\right)^2+b\\)).\n", "generalfeedback": "Our aim is to 'destroy' the \\(x\\) term. We do this by considering the general quadratic:\n\\[ x^2+2ax+b. \\]\nConsider,\n\\[\\left(x-a \\right)^2 = x^2-2ax+a^2. \\]\nTherefore we can see that:\n\\[ x^2+2ax+b = \\left( x-a \\right)^2-a^2+b. \\]\n<br>\nSo in this example we have {{CT:2}}. Therefore we complete the square:\n\\[ {{CT:3}} = {{CT:4}}.\\]", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "CompSquare", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "b", "ta", "v"], "nvariants": 50}